{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39686","headline":"寄罗浮山道者二首 一 · 黄滔","name":"寄罗浮山道者二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天际双山压海濆，天漫绝顶海漫根。\n时闻雷雨惊樵客，长有龙蛇护洞门。\n泉石暮含朱槿书，烟霞冬闭木绵温。\n林间学道如容我，今便辞他宠辱喧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39686.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39686","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}